    other key mean the item is shaped for something else and is rejected whole.
    The values themselves are checked by the ordinary single-request readers, so
    a batch item fails with the same error codes as an equivalent standalone
    rollback.
    """
    if not isinstance(item, dict):
        raise JournalError("invalid-batch-item")
